      "message": "According to following javadoc, APN_SET_ID is a feature that only the APN associated with APN_SET_ID of Preferred APN is used.\nTherefore, the situation that keep connection with APN NOT associated with APN_SET_ID of preferred APN becomes a problem, so we think that CarrierConfig is not needed.\n\n/**\n * The APN set id. When the user manually selects an APN or the framework sets an APN as\n * preferred, the device can only use APNs with the same set id as the selected APN.\n * \u003cp\u003eType: INTEGER\u003c/p\u003e\n * @hide\n */\n@SystemApi\npublic static final String APN_SET_ID \u003d \"apn_set_id\";",
